  Tells SignPath what to sign inside the artifact the workflow uploads (a zip holding the installer).
  Paste this into the project's "initial" artifact configuration in SignPath, or check it against
  https://docs.signpath.io/artifact-configuration if their schema has moved.
-->
<artifact-configuration xmlns="http://signpath.io/artifact-configuration/v1">
